{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Here is a comparison using the illustrative table. Brick has a conductivity of 1.00, while fibreglass has 0.04. Dividing 1.00 by 0.04 gives 25. This means brick's thermal conductivity is 25 times that of fibreglass. For equal thickness, area and temperature difference, conduction through the brick would be approximately 25 times greater. It is more precise to compare conductivity than to say a material is '25 times better' without stating the conditions.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 36.257959, "words": [["Here", 0.0], ["is", 0.29], ["a", 0.43], ["comparison", 0.522], ["using", 1.196], ["the", 1.567], ["illustrative", 1.718], ["table.", 2.473], ["Brick", 3.251], ["has", 3.727], ["a", 4.133], ["conductivity", 4.319], ["of", 5.294], ["1.00,", 5.573], ["while", 7.059], ["fibreglass", 7.442], ["has", 8.104], ["0.04.", 8.51], ["Dividing", 9.88], ["1.00", 10.414], ["by", 11.564], ["0.04", 11.761], ["gives", 12.585], ["25.", 12.841], ["This", 13.665], ["means", 13.967], ["brick's", 14.338], ["thermal", 14.756], ["conductivity", 15.186], ["is", 16.022], ["25", 16.324], ["times", 17.055], ["that", 17.415], ["of", 17.752], ["fibreglass.", 17.972], ["For", 18.889], ["equal", 19.191], ["thickness,", 19.703], ["area", 20.457], ["and", 20.945], ["temperature", 21.142], ["difference,", 21.711], ["conduction", 22.628], ["through", 23.313], ["the", 23.662], ["brick", 23.789], ["would", 24.37], ["be", 24.672], ["approximately", 24.846], ["25", 25.798], ["times", 26.39], ["greater.", 26.75], ["It", 27.69], ["is", 27.864], ["more", 28.027], ["precise", 28.259], ["to", 28.793], ["compare", 28.956], ["conductivity", 29.42], ["than", 30.43], ["to", 30.709], ["say", 30.929], ["a", 31.313], ["material", 31.44], ["is", 32.137], ["'25", 32.334], ["times", 33.077], ["better'", 33.46], ["without", 34.18], ["stating", 34.598], ["the", 35.132], ["conditions.", 35.283]], "raw": [{"text": "Here", "start": 0.0, "end